> POST /proxy?url=http://127.0.0.1:<plain-port>/echo
> Origin: https://test.example.com
> X-Proxy-Token: <token>
> Content-Type: application/json
>
> {"hello":"golden"}

< 200
< Access-Control-Allow-Headers: Content-Type, X-Proxy-Token, X-Target-Authorization, X-Target-Origin
< Access-Control-Allow-Methods: GET, HEAD, POST, OPTIONS
< Access-Control-Allow-Origin: https://test.example.com
< Access-Control-Allow-Private-Network: true
< Access-Control-Expose-Headers: Content-Length, Content-Type, Date, X-Upstream-Content-Encoding, X-Upstream-Content-Length, X-Upstream-Final-URL, X-Upstream-IP, X-Upstream-Location, X-Upstream-Protocol, X-Upstream-Redirects, X-Upstream-Timing, X-Upstream-Truncated
< Access-Control-Max-Age: 600
< Content-Length: 198
< Content-Type: application/json
< Date: <date>
< Vary: Origin
< Vary: X-Target-Authorization
< X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
< X-Upstream-Content-Length: 198
< X-Upstream-Ip: 127.0.0.1
< X-Upstream-Protocol: HTTP/1.1
< X-Upstream-Timing: dns=<ms>;tcp=<ms>;ssl=<ms>;ttfb=<ms>;total=<ms>

